#: .\templates\pages\terms_conditions.html:21
msgid ""
"Restaurants are responsible for their menu items, prices, images, "
"descriptions, availability, allergens, taxes, fees, opening hours, and order"
" handling. Content must not infringe third-party rights or violate "
"applicable law."
